record("Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-5", "{\"id\":\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-5\",\"speaker\":\"Codex\",\"text\":\"The button and restricted login-screen permission are implemented. Tests confirm that the command sets Windows for one boot, and that it won’t reboot if Windows is missing or the firmware write fails. I’m building the greeter and checking the pre-login flow in the VM.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\",\"host\":\"dhilipsiva-desktop\",\"source\":\"codex\",\"session\":\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\",\"channel\":\"commentary\",\"about\":[\"nixos\",\"windows\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
