record("Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-9", "{\"id\":\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows-9\",\"speaker\":\"Codex\",\"text\":\"Implemented in the [desktop configuration](/home/dhilipsiva/projects/dhilipsiva/NixOS/hosts/desktop/windows.nix).\\n\\n- **Command:** `reboot-to-windows` — already installed.\\n- **Login button:** **F11 Reboot to Windows**, then **Enter** to confirm or **Esc** to cancel. Works before login.\\n\\nFormatting, flake checks, VM login tests, and all-host builds passed.\\n\\nThe button isn’t live yet: these changes still need publication, staging through `nixosctl stage --host desktop`, and a manual reboot.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-18T18:09:20Z\",\"host\":\"dhilipsiva-desktop\",\"source\":\"codex\",\"session\":\"Codex-2026-10-18-NixOS-windows\",\"channel\":\"final\",\"about\":[\"nixos\",\"windows\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
